{"id":"n55678-1-7","stage":5,"title":"무심히 · 无心地","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n55678-1-7-1","ko":"지수 얼굴이 그 배우랑 좀 닮지 않았니?","zh":"智秀的脸是不是有点像那个演员？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지수","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀","readings":[{"term":"지수","audio":"/audio/0d32317250d77806a4f2.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지수","audio":"/audio/0d32317250d77806a4f2.mp3"}},{"text":"얼굴이","meaning":"容貌","explanation":"얼굴：容貌；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"얼굴","audio":"/audio/886ae927b512e2e4bc7b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17183","senseId":"2","lemma":"얼굴","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"얼굴이","audio":"/audio/81669bb10178aa2a65c6.mp3"}},{"text":"그","meaning":"那个","explanation":"그：那个","readings":[{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"43883","senseId":"2","lemma":"그","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}},{"text":"배우랑","meaning":"演员","explanation":"배우：演员；랑：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。","readings":[{"term":"배우","audio":"/audio/70129359d515b77048d9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58204","senseId":"1","lemma":"배우","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"배우랑","audio":"/audio/5263d9af69e40a200e5f.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一点点，有一点","explanation":"좀：一点点，有一点","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"1","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"닮지","meaning":"像，随","explanation":"닮다：像，随；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"닮다","audio":"/audio/593cd68a248859878955.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73354","senseId":"1","lemma":"닮다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"닮지","audio":"/audio/2c247f76ac4b351d99cf.mp3"}},{"text":"않았니?","meaning":"不","explanation":"않다：不；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"않다","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71583","senseId":"1","lemma":"않다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"않았니","audio":"/audio/779844dd4334d4e835f6.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"886ae927b512e2e4","term":"얼굴","zh":"容貌","audio":"/audio/886ae927b512e2e4bc7b.mp3","entryId":"17183","definition":"头部前面部分的整体长相或样子。","pronunciation":["얼굴"]},{"id":"38c61820e786f234","term":"그","zh":"那个","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3","entryId":"43883","definition":"指代前面已经讲过的对象。","pronunciation":["그"]},{"id":"70129359d515b770","term":"배우","zh":"演员","audio":"/audio/70129359d515b77048d9.mp3","entryId":"58204","definition":"担任电影、话剧或电视剧等中的人物角色进行表演的人。","pronunciation":["배우"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一点点，有一点","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"分量或程度稀少地。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"593cd68a24885987","term":"닮다","zh":"像，随","audio":"/audio/593cd68a248859878955.mp3","entryId":"73354","definition":"指两个以上的人或事物拥有相似的长相或属性。","pronunciation":["담ː따"]},{"id":"b69b8939cafeac28","term":"않다","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3","entryId":"71583","definition":"用于否定前文所指的状态。","pronunciation":["안타"]}],"audio":"/audio/b0211d09c455fc0151f9.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n55678-1-7-2","ko":"응. 그동안은 무심히 봐서 몰랐는데 그런 것도 같아.","zh":"嗯，以前没仔细看，没发现，现在想想好像是。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}},{"text":"그동안은","meaning":"那个；期间","explanation":"그：那个；동안：期间；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"},{"term":"동안","audio":"/audio/2aa02e1d6b86b37d7e2b.mp3"}]